       "id": "9512417"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "9660920"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Found in a complex with XPOT, Ran and tRNA. Probably found in a complex with nucleoporins. Interacts with Ran and tRNA in a GTP-dependent manner"
    }
   ],
